<title>USA: Eden Prairie ISD 272 won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Eden Prairie ISD 272 won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc., said it won $7.070 million of Eden Prairie ISD 272, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.3248 percent.</p>
